---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
import { DocsSidebar } from '@/components/Docs'
import { Button, Heading, Section, Text } from '@core/ui'
---
<Layout title="Documentation - Ultimate Landing Page Template" description="Learn how to install, configure, and build with the Ultimate Landing Page Template.">
  <div style="display: flex; max-width: var(--sizes-container); margin: 0 auto;">
    <DocsSidebar client:load />
    
    <Section style={{ flex: 1, paddingTop: '120px', paddingBottom: '120px', minHeight: '80vh', paddingLeft: '32px', paddingRight: '32px', overflowX: 'hidden' }}>
      <div id="installing" style={{ scrollMarginTop: '120px', marginBottom: '64px' }}>
        <Heading as="h1" size="5xl" style={{ marginBottom: '16px', letterSpacing: '-0.02em' }}>Installing</Heading>
        <Text size="lg" color="text" style={{ opacity: 0.8, maxWidth: '600px' }}>
          Get up and running with the ultimate Astro & React launchpad in seconds.
        </Text>
        
        <div style={{ marginTop: '24px', backgroundColor: 'color-mix(in srgb, var(--colors-hoverTint) 40%, transparent)', padding: '32px', borderRadius: '16px', border: '1px solid var(--colors-hoverTint)' }}>
          <Text size="base" color="text" style={{ fontFamily: 'monospace', lineHeight: '2' }}>
            pnpm create astro@latest --template wjuniorw/astro-ai-landing-kit my-app<br/>
            cd my-app<br/>
            pnpm install<br/>
            pnpm dev
          </Text>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="seo" style={{ scrollMarginTop: '120px', marginBottom: '64px' }}>
        <Heading as="h2" size="4xl" style={{ marginBottom: '16px', letterSpacing: '-0.02em' }}>SEO & Meta Tags</Heading>
        <Text size="lg" color="text" style={{ opacity: 0.8, maxWidth: '600px' }}>
          Astro provides the perfect foundation for SEO. You can easily inject OpenGraph tags, dynamic Titles, and Twitter cards straight into your `Layout.astro` frontmatter.
        </Text>
      </div>

      <div id="components" style={{ scrollMarginTop: '120px', marginBottom: '64px' }}>
        <Heading as="h2" size="4xl" style={{ marginBottom: '24px', letterSpacing: '-0.02em' }}>Built-in Components</Heading>
        
        <Heading as="h3" size="3xl" style={{ marginBottom: '16px' }}>Typography</Heading>
        <div style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '16px', marginBottom: '32px', padding: '32px', backgroundColor: 'color-mix(in srgb, var(--colors-hoverTint) 20%, transparent)', borderRadius: '16px', border: '1px solid var(--colors-hoverTint)' }}>
          <Heading size="4xl">This is a 4xl Heading</Heading>
          <Text size="lg" color="primary">This is large primary text.</Text>
          <Text size="sm" color="text" style={{ opacity: 0.6 }}>This is small muted text.</Text>
        </div>

        <Heading as="h3" size="3xl" style={{ marginBottom: '16px' }}>Buttons</Heading>
        <div style={{ display: 'flex', gap: '16px', flexWrap: 'wrap', padding: '32px', backgroundColor: 'color-mix(in srgb, var(--colors-hoverTint) 20%, transparent)', borderRadius: '16px', border: '1px solid var(--colors-hoverTint)' }}>
          <Button>Primary Button</Button>
          <Button variant="ghost">Ghost Button</Button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="prompts" style={{ scrollMarginTop: '120px', marginBottom: '64px' }}>
        <Heading as="h2" size="4xl" style={{ marginBottom: '16px', letterSpacing: '-0.02em' }}>AI Prompt Examples</Heading>
        <Text size="lg" color="text" style={{ opacity: 0.8, maxWidth: '600px' }}>
          Leverage the embedded skills in the `.agents/skills` folder. Try running this command in your IDE copilot:
          <br/><br/>
          <i>"Create a new section below the Hero that highlights our 3 core pricing tiers. Use the design tokens from `@core/ui`."</i>
        </Text>
      </div>

      <div id="troubleshooting" style={{ scrollMarginTop: '120px', marginBottom: '64px' }}>
        <Heading as="h2" size="4xl" style={{ marginBottom: '16px', letterSpacing: '-0.02em' }}>Troubleshooting</Heading>
        <Text size="lg" color="text" style={{ opacity: 0.8, maxWidth: '600px' }}>
          If you encounter issues deploying to Cloudflare Pages related to the lockfile, ensure you run `pnpm install` locally before pushing to sync `pnpm-lock.yaml` with any package manager config updates.
        </Text>
      </div>
    </Section>
  </div>
</Layout>
